<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>ZyGPT ó engineering copilot (maintenance)</title>
<meta name="description" content="ZyGPT internal engineering copilot ó diagnostic chat console." />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0e14;
    --bg2: #0f141d;
    --panel: #131a24;
    --panel2: #1a2330;
    --ink: #d7e0ec;
    --ink-dim: #93a1b5;
    --ink-faint: #5e6b7e;
    --line: #243044;
    --accent: #4fd1c5;
    --accent2: #7aa2ff;
    --warn: #f6ad55;
    --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Code", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--mono); line-height: 1.55; font-size: 15px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
  }
  .wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 820px; padding: 22px 18px 40px; }
  header.bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .3px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .brand .dot { color: var(--accent); }
  .pill {
    font-size: .72rem; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--warn); background: var(--bg2);
  }
  .meta { margin-left: auto; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: .76rem; }
  .note { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: .85rem; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .console {
    background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; min-height: 280px;
  }
  .turn { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .who { font-size: .72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .who.you { color: var(--accent2); }
  .who.zygpt { color: var(--accent); }
  .say { margin: 3px 0 0; white-space: pre-wrap; color: var(--ink); }
  .say.dim { color: var(--ink-dim); }
  form.composer {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; align-items: flex-end;
  }
  textarea {
    flex: 1; resize: vertical; min-height: 52px; max-height: 220px;
    font: inherit; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 12px;
  }
  textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }
  button.send {
    font: inherit; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
    background: #11343150; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid #2c6a64;
    padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;
  }
  button.send:hover { color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }
  footer.foot { margin-top: 22px; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: .74rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="bar">
    <div class="brand"><span class="dot">&#9679;</span> ZyGPT</div>
    <span class="pill">maintenance / diagnostic</span>
    <div class="meta">build pulled 2026-06-18 &middot; integrity: UNDER REVIEW</div>
  </header>

  <p class="note">
    ZyGPT internal engineering copilot. What do you want to build today?
  </p>

  <div class="console">
    <div class="turn">
      <div class="who zygpt">zygpt</div>
      <p class="say">ZyGPT, you? e?gineering co-pilÿ?.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="turn">
      <div class="who you">you</div>
      <p class="say dim">Type a message below and press Send.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <form class="composer" action="500.html" method="get">
    <textarea name="message" placeholder="Send a message&hellip;" aria-label="message"></textarea>
    <button class="send" type="submit">Send</button>
  </form>

  <footer class="foot">
    ZyGPT &middot; build &middot; ZG-2026-0488
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>

